sequenceDiagram
    actor Doctor
    participant SPA as React SPA
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant AIController as AI Controller\n(Laravel AI SDK)
    participant ClaudeAPI as Claude API\n(claude-sonnet)
    participant Tools as Tool Handlers
    participant DB

    Doctor->>SPA: Type question in chatbox\ne.g. "Summarize patient #12 last 3 visits"
    SPA->>API: POST /api/ai/chat\n{ patient_id, message }\nAuthorization: Bearer token
    API->>API: Validate token + role check (admin/doktor)
    API->>AIController: handle(patient_id, message)

    AIController->>ClaudeAPI: messages: [system prompt + user message]\ntools: [get_patient, list_visits, get_visit,\n        get_risk_score, list_labs]

    loop Tool use loop
        ClaudeAPI-->>AIController: tool_use: { name, input }
        AIController->>Tools: dispatch(tool_name, input)
        Tools->>DB: SELECT (patient, visits, labs, etc.)
        DB-->>Tools: Records
        Tools-->>AIController: tool_result
        AIController->>ClaudeAPI: tool_result message
    end

    ClaudeAPI-->>AIController: text response (stop_reason: end_turn)
    AIController-->>API: streamed SSE chunks
    API-->>SPA: SSE stream: data: { chunk }\ndata: [DONE]
    SPA-->>Doctor: Streamed assistant response rendered
